  "notes": "{上|あ}げる is a highly versatile verb with multiple meanings and uses.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {上|あ}がる (intransitive, to rise)\n\nMEANINGS:\n1. To raise/lift: {手|て}を{上|あ}げる (raise one's hand)\n2. To give: プレゼントを{上|あ}げる (give a present)\n3. To improve: {効率|こうりつ}を{上|あ}げる (raise efficiency)\n\nAUXILIARY USE:\n〜てあげる expresses doing something for someone's benefit (speaker → other):\n- {教|おし}えてあげる: to teach (for someone)\n- {手伝|てつだ}ってあげる: to help (for someone)\n\nNOTE:\nWhen giving to social superiors, use {差|さ}し{上|あ}げる instead.",
